+--- remint_form_token(old_token: String, new_token: String)
+-- The expired-link "Send me a new link" flow (Story RC3.3, UX §8.5):
+-- re-mints the capability token and stamps a fresh 10-day TTL (A3) in one
+-- guarded UPDATE. Guards: the row must still be open (contact_initiated),
+-- not taken over (a taken-over row's messages are the landlord's domain,
+-- A7), and genuinely expired — which makes the endpoint self-rate-limiting:
+-- a replay with the old token finds no row (the token died here), and a
+-- replay with the new token fails the expiry guard (fresh 10-day window).
+-- 0 rows = the state moved under the referee; the handler re-classifies
+-- and renders the truthful page instead.
+UPDATE reference_call
+SET form_token = $2::text,
+    form_token_expires_at = now() + interval '10 days'
+WHERE form_token = $1
+  AND status = 'contact_initiated'
+  AND taken_over_at IS NULL
+  AND form_token_expires_at IS NOT NULL
+  AND form_token_expires_at < now()
+RETURNING id::text;
